  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PbS</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>PbO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Pb</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><p>It is self-reduction reaction.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;In the extraction process of copper from copper pyrites, silica is added to produce Iron silicate.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;Partial oxidation of sulphide ore of copper by roasting, followed by self-reduction produces&nbsp;blister copper.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cu</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><munder><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow/></munder><msub><mi>Cu</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cu</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>Cu</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><munder><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi>self</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>reduction</mi></mrow></munder><mn>6</mn><mi>Cu</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Na</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Au</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Zn</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub></mro